(7233809, 1119794, 18197, '<td valign="top">This is such a great shot in many ways: Subject; Lines; Colors; Contrast; Composition. It has a dreamy quality I like. But for me, the distracting halos produced by the processing diminishes it. It''s a great photo but I''m not a great viewer.</td>', 'This is such a great shot in many ways: Subject; Lines; Colors; Contrast; Composition. It has a dreamy quality I like. But for me, the distracting halos produced by the processing diminishes it. It''s a great photo but I''m not a great viewer.', '2014-06-27 01:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
