(7233867, 1119766, 140305, '<td valign="top">I really like this a lot. The only thing is, it may not read as silhouette to voters. It seems to be more of an abstract, it is so many things, but maybe not a silhouette! Maybe I''m just being too close-minded but I think if your score suffers it will be because some voters are thinking like this......hope I''m wrong. Still, I''m giving  it a 7 because I like your style :)</td>', 'I really like this a lot. The only thing is, it may not read as silhouette to voters. It seems to be more of an abstract, it is so many things, but maybe not a silhouette! Maybe I''m just being too close-minded but I think if your score suffers it will be because some voters are thinking like this......hope I''m wrong. Still, I''m giving  it a 7 because I like your style :)', '2014-06-27 03:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
