(7235897, 1118780, 114285, '<td valign="top">This would of been soooo good, if it was actually a silhouette, but the fact that I can read his t-shirt suggests you may of needed to wait until the sunset a little more.<br/> <br/>Funny thing on my ipad it was quite dark, but when I went to check it  on my desktop it was a lot lighter.</td>', 'This would of been soooo good, if it was actually a silhouette, but the fact that I can read his t-shirt suggests you may of needed to wait until the sunset a little more. Funny thing on my ipad it was quite dark, but when I went to check it  on my desktop it was a lot lighter.', '2014-07-02 22:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
