(7236020, 1119064, 156466, '<td valign="top">A little busy, with most of your silhouettes fighting shadows.  Had you held the camera about 3 feet lower it might have made it ore interesting.</td>', 'A little busy, with most of your silhouettes fighting shadows.  Had you held the camera about 3 feet lower it might have made it ore interesting.', '2014-07-03 11:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
