(7236022, 1119746, 156466, '<td valign="top">Something about the horizon seems wrong, even though I checked it and it''s not crooked - it''s just a perspective thing, and the horizon sits a little too low and the lighthouse a little too far right for me to want to like this.  It''s a nice photo but the composition just doesn''t work for me.  6</td>', 'Something about the horizon seems wrong, even though I checked it and it''s not crooked - it''s just a perspective thing, and the horizon sits a little too low and the lighthouse a little too far right for me to want to like this.  It''s a nice photo but the composition just doesn''t work for me.  6', '2014-07-03 11:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
