(7236151, 1119865, 38921, '<td valign="top">Nice color and simplicity here.  I am seeing some artifacts along the top of the body and right side of the neck.  Not sure if they are from sharpening or some cloning.</td>', 'Nice color and simplicity here.  I am seeing some artifacts along the top of the body and right side of the neck.  Not sure if they are from sharpening or some cloning.', '2014-07-03 16:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
