(7236156, 1119485, 38921, '<td valign="top">Too much detail for me in the primary subjects (dock, boy and dog) here to be a true silhouette.</td>', 'Too much detail for me in the primary subjects (dock, boy and dog) here to be a true silhouette.', '2014-07-03 16:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
