(7236274, 1118780, 124815, '<td valign="top">Totally engrossing. Composition, shapes, luck, sky, tonalityall coincided to make a great image.<br/> <br/>I urge you to reduce the sharpening and skew from the left corners just so slightly so that you you make the horizontal line straight - and then print it large and put it on the wall!<br/>(I''m wondering if this is not one of Anita''s temerary kids. A little jewel)<br/>bump to 9</td>', 'Totally engrossing. Composition, shapes, luck, sky, tonalityall coincided to make a great image. I urge you to reduce the sharpening and skew from the left corners just so slightly so that you you make the horizontal line straight - and then print it large and put it on the wall!(I''m wondering if this is not one of Anita''s temerary kids. A little jewel)bump to 9', '2014-07-03 23:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236276, 1119981, 124815, '<td valign="top">most gracious and so well titled - the shape forms a secret calligraphy and yet. there is the pushed-to-the-limit photo processing to which I resist perhaps because I know pretty much how it''s obtained and thus diminishes the mystery<br/>bump to 9</td>', 'most gracious and so well titled - the shape forms a secret calligraphy and yet. there is the pushed-to-the-limit photo processing to which I resist perhaps because I know pretty much how it''s obtained and thus diminishes the mysterybump to 9', '2014-07-03 23:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236278, 1120005, 124815, '<td valign="top">Marvelous little jewel. I immediately associate it with some literary work, it could make a fabulous book cover (provided you take care of the little negligence on the right edge)<br/>a good bump to 9</td>', 'Marvelous little jewel. I immediately associate it with some literary work, it could make a fabulous book cover (provided you take care of the little negligence on the right edge)a good bump to 9', '2014-07-03 23:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236279, 1119925, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>I like how this is very different from the rest of the entries. The mood of the shot deals with depression and feelings of isolation. The subject of the shot is in a very dark place removed from the outside world. He chooses to look out the window and stay in the comfort of his 4 walls rather than venture outside into the light. Very moody piece and well done. My only critique is that I think it would be even stronger if you cropped out a little more of the negative space at the top and to the right so that your main subject and his visible surroundings fill the frame more.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. I like how this is very different from the rest of the entries. The mood of the shot deals with depression and feelings of isolation. The subject of the shot is in a very dark place removed from the outside world. He chooses to look out the window and stay in the comfort of his 4 walls rather than venture outside into the light. Very moody piece and well done. My only critique is that I think it would be even stronger if you cropped out a little more of the negative space at the top and to the right so that your main subject and his visible surroundings fill the frame more.', '2014-07-03 23:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236282, 1119950, 124815, '<td valign="top">A much used idea but very well done; the authoritarian gesture gives much aplomb<br/>bump</td>', 'A much used idea but very well done; the authoritarian gesture gives much aplombbump', '2014-07-03 23:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
