(7236285, 1119339, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment. <br/> <br/>Great vibrant and warm orange/ gold hues that play directly into the tone of happiness. Dance like nobody''s watching - heh, I can hear Pharrell Williams tune Happy playing. Great capture of the model losing themselves in the enjoyment of the dance. Love how you (or perhaps just a happy coincidence) composed the shot so that the clouds dress the barren tree like foliage. Very well done will likely be in the top 5.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment.  Great vibrant and warm orange/ gold hues that play directly into the tone of happiness. Dance like nobody''s watching - heh, I can hear Pharrell Williams tune Happy playing. Great capture of the model losing themselves in the enjoyment of the dance. Love how you (or perhaps just a happy coincidence) composed the shot so that the clouds dress the barren tree like foliage. Very well done will likely be in the top 5.', '2014-07-03 23:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7236287, 1119943, 124815, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and yes, a bit predictable, but we cannot have a novel view at hand all the time. I like the scattered birds and the zig zagging line of the foreground that makes a good statement<br/>bump</td>', 'Beautiful and yes, a bit predictable, but we cannot have a novel view at hand all the time. I like the scattered birds and the zig zagging line of the foreground that makes a good statementbump', '2014-07-03 23:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
