(7236511, 1119678, 175946, '<td valign="top">I gave this an 8 and am surprised it did not finish much higher. Technically well composed, great exposure for the challenge, beautiful blue sky. I can only assume the majority of voters have never had the opportunity to behold the view of a majestic cactus, so they just did not appreciate the grandeur of your image. To bad for them, at least you and I just love it.</td>', 'I gave this an 8 and am surprised it did not finish much higher. Technically well composed, great exposure for the challenge, beautiful blue sky. I can only assume the majority of voters have never had the opportunity to behold the view of a majestic cactus, so they just did not appreciate the grandeur of your image. To bad for them, at least you and I just love it.', '2014-07-04 08:37:44.000000', NULL, 0),
